From 5e5aa842675f1b20c5b44a8804729b82e7067885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scadretto <scadretto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:14:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Expose versioned worker jobs and dependencies

Publish validated binary geometry and source-scoped execution
records over private job files. Observe the actual inputs chosen
by OpenSCAD while leaving the base evaluation unchanged.
